     1	// Prototype (c): full-width 128-bit row processing + stride-direct loads.
     2	//
     3	// Round-0006 prototype (c): load each row as one int16x8_t directly with the
     4	// caller stride (no intermediate block buffer), compute E/O pairs with one
     5	// widening add/sub per row, and keep the TREE-shaped odd-column reduction
     6	// (upstream structure) so the critical path stays short on N1. O is computed
