docs/02-system-architecture.md-45-shape: {height: 8, width: 8}
docs/02-system-architecture.md-46-memory:
docs/02-system-architecture.md-47-  reads:
docs/02-system-architecture.md-48-    - "pixel_a[y * stride1 + x], 0 <= y,x < 8"
docs/02-system-architecture.md-49-    - "pixel_b[y * stride2 + x], 0 <= y,x < 8"
docs/02-system-architecture.md-50-  writes: []
docs/02-system-architecture.md:51:  alias: pixel_a may_alias pixel_b
docs/02-system-architecture.md-52-preconditions:
docs/02-system-architecture.md-53-  - all declared reads are valid
docs/02-system-architecture.md-54-  - stride units are elements
docs/02-system-architecture.md-55-numeric:
docs/02-system-architecture.md-56-  bit_depth: 8
docs/02-system-architecture.md-57-  result_semantics: exact_x265_reference
