   151	    The upstream dct8 seed loads each row as two adjacent `<4 x i16>` loads
   152	    (offsets o and o+8 bytes). AArch64 can load 8 lanes in one instruction and
   153	    split them in registers with vget_low/vget_high, removing one load and its
   154	    address node per row. Only pairs whose `+8` address node has a single
   155	    consuming load are rewritten; everything else is left untouched.
